sed / ESCALATE without a round / re-gaze (attribution, verify-gate, raid); trace-pr-join keeps comment counting by design. (2) holds. (3) holds: an unparsable body line makes append_seats return 1 and capture_pr stop; a prefixed id still goes through strict identity. (4) answer write failure still exits 2 on both paths and posts no pointer; pointer failure is exit-neutral for ForgeRefusal only (finding 1).\nExit criteria 1301: gaze writes no full comment (holds); readers on notes, tests updated (holds); texts and STATE one path (holds); `make check` not run by this review.\nUnresolved simplify: not planned\n\nduration: duration: 3m24s\ntelemetry: wall=na agents=2 tokens=na cost~=$na\nseat: correctness \u00b7 runtime=claude-code \u00b7 family=anthropic \u00b7 route=headless \u00b7 model=anthropic/sonnet \u00b7 status: ran\nseat: redteam \u00b7 runtime=codex \u00b7 family=openai \u00b7 route=headless \u00b7 model=openai/gpt-6.1-sol \u00b7 status: ran\n"}

